<h2>Context strip</h2>

<p>The attribution block at the head of every case study. It is the reason a reader
who stops after the first screen still leaves with an accurate picture of who did
what.</p>

<dl class="context-strip">
    <div class="context-strip__row">
        <dt>Role at the time</dt>
        <dd>QA Automation Engineer</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="context-strip__row">
